# Morning Star harness (.mstar/) — tracked, so a new worktree carries it.
#
# The harness directory travels with Git. A fresh `git worktree add` therefore
# gets the same `.mstar/` the primary checkout has, instead of the tracked
# results subset only. This supersedes the earlier process-local boundary (compass
# D11 in `{HARNESS_DIR}/AGENTS.md`): the process face is no longer withheld.
#
# Only genuinely per-machine, per-run or engine-owned state stays out — a
# snapshot of a live session is not a deliverable, and committing one would churn
# the repository on every command. Everything else under `.mstar/` is tracked.
#
# Local-by-nature exclusions (see `{HARNESS_DIR}/AGENTS.md` § What stays local):
#   sdd/                          — SDD runtime scratch: the engine marks every
#                                   `<plan-id>/` dir with its own `.gitignore`
#                                   holding `*` (`mstar sdd workspace`), and a
#                                   nested ignore file outranks these rules, so
#                                   this line states what the engine already
#                                   decides rather than fighting it
#   snapshots/                    — a live engine/status cache, rewritten often
#   sess-probe.log                — a session log
#   *.bak*, *.bak-*               — operator backups of register files
#   .execution-maintenance/       — machine-local execution scratch
.mstar/sdd/
.mstar/snapshots/
.mstar/**/sess-probe.log
.mstar/**/*.bak*
.mstar/**/*.bak-*
.mstar/.execution-maintenance/
# runtime / media
bilibili-asr-archive/archive/audio/
bilibili-asr-archive/archive/transcripts/
bilibili-asr-archive/logs/
# local ASR checkpoints: multi-GB operator-downloaded weights, never tracked
bilibili-asr-archive/models/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
.env
*.m4a
*.wav

# editor / scratch leftovers
*.swp
*.swo

.worktrees/
.tmp/
.tmp2/
pydiagout.txt
bilibili-asr-archive/.test-tmp/
bilibili-asr-archive/.pytest-*/
bilibili-asr-archive/.tb/
bilibili-asr-archive/.pfx*/
bilibili-asr-archive/.pydel*/
bilibili-asr-archive/pip-*/
bilibili-asr-archive/pytest-cache-files-*/
bilibili-asr-archive/archive/manifest/
bilibili-asr-archive/verification-results/baseline.json

# pre-iteration prototype scratch data (regenerable; code preserved under docs/archive/pre-iteration-2026-09/)
bilibili-asr-archive/refactor/

# Test reports and temporary files
e2e-test*.md
**/verify_acceptance.sh


# mstar issue/catalog/roadmap SQLite (process authority; local)
.mstar/store.db*
